title: Route project-schema keys to their declared flags in field refusals
description: "Observed during SDK delivery: update with --field gate_evidence=<JSON> refuses that key as absent from active extension registrations and lists only unrelated extension fields. The same workspace declares gate_evidence as an object field with cli_flag --gate-evidence; schema show-field and update contracts expose it, and the dedicated flag succeeds. Extend field recovery to distinguish configured project-schema fields from extension item fields and provide the executable declared CLI/SDK route. Preserve extension-field admission and no-write refusals. This is a recovery/discovery gap, not a request to bypass schema validation or reinterpret arbitrary extension fields."
